# Perf suite: aggressive flings on inverted Chat, into history (finger down) and back to the
# newest message, then MVCP: incoming messages (append 262 78) and history loads (prepend
# 210 78) at rest and mid-fling while scrolled up, each followed by a still pause.
# {FLINGS}/{HALF} come from perf-suite.sh (sized to SLCount), or run.sh defaults.
route Chat
latency 0,0
wait 3
mark fling-into-history
repeat {FLINGS} pan 200 150 0 580 100
wait 2
mark rest-in-history
wait 1.5
mark fling-to-bottom
repeat {FLINGS} pan 200 730 0 -580 100
wait 2
mark rest-at-bottom
wait 1.5
mark append-at-bottom
press 262 78
wait 2.5
mark scroll-mid
repeat {HALF} pan 200 150 0 580 100
wait 2.5
mark append-at-rest
press 262 78
wait 2.5
mark prepend-at-rest
press 210 78
wait 2.5
mark append-mid-fling
pan 200 150 0 580 100
press 262 78
wait 3
mark prepend-mid-fling
pan 200 730 0 -580 100
press 210 78
wait 3
mark burst-between-flings
pan 200 150 0 580 100
repeat 3 press 262 78
pan 200 150 0 580 100
wait 3
mark back-to-bottom
repeat {FLINGS} pan 200 730 0 -580 100
wait 3
